.TH orbweaver-interfaces 1  "interfaces " 
.SH NAME
interfaces \- 🔌 List the CLI subcommands detected in a snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBinterfaces\fR [\fB\-\-snapshot\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
🔌 List the CLI subcommands detected in a snapshot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-snapshot\fR \fI<SNAPSHOT>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR
Only show interfaces for this repository id
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
